WEBVTT

00:06:28.862 --> 00:06:30.237
So what needs to be done?

00:06:30.261 --> 00:06:32.238
Because the risk,

00:06:32.262 --> 00:06:35.005
the high probability
of climate change is real.

00:06:35.417 --> 00:06:36.821
It's real.

00:06:36.845 --> 00:06:39.612
Of course, they must be
more energy efficient.

00:06:40.516 --> 00:06:42.630
They must change
their behavior in some way.

00:06:42.654 --> 00:06:45.090
They must also start
to produce green energy,

00:06:45.114 --> 00:06:46.339
much more green energy.

00:06:46.363 --> 00:06:49.735
But until they have the same
energy consumption per person,

00:06:49.759 --> 00:06:51.670
they shouldn't give advice to others --

00:06:51.694 --> 00:06:53.190
what to do and what not to do.

00:06:53.214 --> 00:06:54.338
(Laughter)

00:06:54.362 --> 00:06:55.540
(Applause)

00:06:55.564 --> 00:07:00.309
Here, we can get more
green energy all over.